      "name": "Mercor",
      "bestFor": "Credentialed domain experts seeking high hourly rates",
      "description": "Mercor is an AI talent marketplace connecting domain experts like doctors, lawyers, and scientists directly with artificial intelligence labs to train models. Mercor publishes no site-wide rate card because rates are set per job listing, though [TechCrunch reported](https://techcrunch.com/2025/10/27/mercor-quintuples-valuation-to-10b-with-350m-series-c/) in October 2025 that its network of more than 30,000 experts averages over $85 per hour. Hourly contractors receive payments every Wednesday around 12:00 PM PST for the prior Saturday through Friday week. Payouts process through Stripe Connect or Wise into a personal bank account denominated in USD. In late March 2026, a cybersecurity breach linked to the LiteLLM supply-chain attack led to several federal contractor class actions alleging exposed personal information.",
