      "description": "Alignerr is an AI workforce platform powered by Labelbox. The platform displays an advertised average pay of $80 per hour on its homepage and states contributors are paid weekly. Individual roles listed on its site range from $30 to $35 per hour for Japanese language specialists up to $40 to $120 per hour for technical domain tasks. The platform evaluates applicants through skill assessments covering language, writing, or specialized technical fields. No lawsuits against Alignerr or parent company Labelbox were found on court dockets in October 2026. However, separate job postings on Greenhouse for United States candidates list lower hourly pay ranges starting between $25 and $38 per hour depending on qualifications.",
