      "bestFor": "Freelancers wanting clear entry-level pay ranges and twice-monthly payouts",
      "description": "Mindrift is a project-based platform built by Toloka AI BV that connects freelance contributors with artificial intelligence training tasks. Its public website publishes transparent hourly ranges: entry-level work pays $15 to $30 per hour, while domain expert tasks pay $60 to $100+ per hour. Some listings display monthly earnings caps, such as up to $6,400 per month for STEM and up to $8,000 for consulting. Compensation is paid per completed, approved task, with rates visible before starting. Payouts process twice a month on the 5th and 20th through Payoneer or Tipalti. Joining requires a resume and skills assessment, and the company maintains explicit regional restrictions due to payment rails.",
