      "question": "What are some websites similar to DataAnnotation?",
      "answer": "The most similar websites are Outlier, Mercor, Alignerr, and Mindrift. Outlier offers prompt generation and model evaluation with weekly Tuesday payouts. Mindrift publishes $15 to $30 per hour for entry-level work, and Alignerr, run by Labelbox, lists roles from $30 to $35 per hour up to $40 to $120 per hour on its homepage."
